msgid "Service Plans"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:59
msgid "Resource Pools"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:60
msgid "Networks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:61
msgid "Security Groups"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:62
msgid "Datastores"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:63
msgid "Folders"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:65
msgid "**Provisioning Command**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:67
msgid "PROXY"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:68
msgid ""
"Set a proxy for inbound communication from Instances to the |morpheus| "
"Appliance. Proxies can be added in the `Infrastructure > Networks > "
"Proxies` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:69
msgid "Bypass Proxy for Appliance URL"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:70
msgid ""
"Enable to bypass proxy settings (if added) for |morpheus| Agent "
"communication to the Appliance URL."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:71
msgid "NO PROXY"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:72
msgid ""
"Include a list of IP addresses or name servers to exclude from proxy "
"traversal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:73
msgid "USER DATA (LINUX)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/advanced_options.rst:74
msgid ""
"Add cloud-init user data. |morpheus| 4.1.0 and earlier assumes bash "
"syntax. |morpheus| 4.1.1 and later supports all User Data formats. Refer "
"to https://cloudinit.readthedocs.io/en/latest/topics/format.html for more"
" information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/alibaba/alibaba.rst:62
msgid "Following Integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/alibaba/alibaba.rst:64
msgid ""
"After the integration has been created, |morpheus| will sync existing "
"workloads (if you've opted to inventory), security groups, tags, and "
"more. Synced workloads can be viewed from :menuselection:`Infrastructure "
"--> Compute`. If Plans aren't immediately available within a few minutes "
"after the integration is created, navigate to the Cloud detail page "
"(|InfClo| > Your Integrated Alibaba Cloud), click :guilabel:`REFRESH` and"
" click \"Daily\". Shortly thereafter, the Plans should be synced and "
"selectable at provision time. Without manually syncing the Plans, you may"
" be unable to provision to this Cloud until it undertakes its next daily "
"sync overnight as Plan selection is required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/alibaba/alibaba.rst:66
msgid ""
"You're now able to provision new Instances and Apps to the Alibaba Cloud."
" |morpheus| includes a default catalog that includes Alibaba images which"
" can be provisioned out of the box. Additionally, you can begin to create"
" your own custom library of Alibaba workloads by adding Virtual Images "
"and building out Instance Types."
msgstr ""

